    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a search profile for a new CEO for one of our global tech clients. We need to really nail down the 'executive presence' requirements for this role. Can you give me a breakdown of the key personality traits and communication styles that someone needs to have to project commanding authority and leadership at the C-suite level?",
